            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_b1ec5ba2-346e-43ad-83a3-4734ec9a3432</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_46e4ae36-79ab-438e-ac0c-0d590ad36404</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_abdf933c-70cd-4928-8d2b-5e9ed915c9f7">
        <inputSet id="Id_636fbb41-dfe6-4c33-8c83-38f651248d0c" />
        <outputSet id="Id_d1210075-b153-483b-96c8-506106383a66" />
      </ioSpecification>
      <resourceRole id="Id_d048fda8-66a1-49cb-a726-9660f8b320cb">
        <q5:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q5="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">EnteFederativo</q5:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_0d718143-dbdf-4c4b-aa70-bb62e5fb1bf8" name="7.2 Formalização do contrato">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 92. S&amp;atilde;o necess&amp;aacute;rias em todo contrato cl&amp;aacute;usulas que estabele&amp;ccedil;am:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - o objeto e seus elementos caracter&amp;iacute;sticos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - a vincula&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ao edital de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e &amp;agrave; proposta do licitante vencedor ou ao ato que tiver autorizado acontrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o direta e &amp;agrave; respectiva proposta;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;III - a legisla&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o aplic&amp;aacute;vel &amp;agrave; execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do contrato, inclusive quanto aos casos omissos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IV - o regime de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou a forma de fornecimento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - o pre&amp;ccedil;o e as condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de pagamento, os crit&amp;eacute;rios, a data-base e a periodicidade do reajustamento depre&amp;ccedil;os e os crit&amp;eacute;rios de atualiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o monet&amp;aacute;ria entre a data do adimplemento das obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e a do efetivopagamento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VI - os crit&amp;eacute;rios e a periodicidade da medi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, quando for o caso, e o prazo para liquida&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e para pagamento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VII - os prazos de in&amp;iacute;cio das etapas de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, conclus&amp;atilde;o, entrega, observa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e recebimento definitivo,quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VIII - o cr&amp;eacute;dito pelo qual correr&amp;aacute; a despesa, com a indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o funcional program&amp;aacute;tica e dacategoria econ&amp;ocirc;mica;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IX - a matriz de risco, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;X - o prazo para resposta ao pedido de repactua&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de pre&amp;ccedil;os, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XI - o prazo para resposta ao pedido de restabelecimento do equil&amp;iacute;brio econ&amp;ocirc;mico-financeiro, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XII - as garantias oferecidas para assegurar sua plena execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, quando exigidas, inclusive as que foremoferecidas pelo contratado no caso de antecipa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de valores a t&amp;iacute;tulo de pagamento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XIII - o prazo de garantia m&amp;iacute;nima do objeto, observados os prazos m&amp;iacute;nimos estabelecidos nesta Lei e nasnormas t&amp;eacute;cnicas aplic&amp;aacute;veis, e as condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de manuten&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e assist&amp;ecirc;ncia t&amp;eacute;cnica, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XIV - os direitos e as responsabilidades das partes, as penalidades cab&amp;iacute;veis e os valores das multas e suasbases de c&amp;aacute;lculo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XV - as condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de importa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a data e a taxa de c&amp;acirc;mbio para convers&amp;atilde;o, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XVI - a obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do contratado de manter, durante toda a execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do contrato, em compatibilidade com asobriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es por ele assumidas, todas as condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es exigidas para a habilita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o na licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, ou para a qualifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, nacontrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o direta;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XVII - a obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de o contratado cumprir as exig&amp;ecirc;ncias de reserva de cargos prevista em lei, bem como emoutras normas espec&amp;iacute;ficas, para pessoa com defici&amp;ecirc;ncia, para reabilitado da Previd&amp;ecirc;ncia Social e para aprendiz;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XVIII - o modelo de gest&amp;atilde;o do contrato, observados os requisitos definidos em regulamento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XIX - os casos de extin&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
